# HackHub Repository Navigation

Begin at the repository root and read `AGENTS.md` before changing files.

- Use `README.md` for setup/deployment and `ARCHITECTURE.md` for design context.
- Backend work belongs in `backend/`; frontend work belongs in `frontend/`.
- Run Supabase migrations in `backend/sql/migrations/` in filename order after `schema.sql`.
- Keep production secrets only in deployment environment variables; never place them in tracked files.
- Preserve unrelated working-tree changes and test the smallest affected surface before handoff.
